        "title": {
          "en": "AWS Aurora DSQL Adds Foreign Key Constraints",
          "zh": "AWS Aurora DSQL 新增外键约束"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "AWS announced support for foreign key constraints in Aurora DSQL, enabling direct enforcement of referential integrity including CASCADE and SET NULL actions.",
          "zh": "AWS 宣布 Aurora DSQL 现已支持外键约束，允许应用程序直接在数据库中强制执行参照完整性，包括 CASCADE 和 SET NULL 等参照动作。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Aurora DSQL now supports foreign key constraints.",
            "Referential integrity can be enforced directly within the database.",
            "Supported referential actions include CASCADE and SET NULL."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Aurora DSQL 现已支持外键约束。",
            "参照完整性现在可以直接在数据库中强制执行。",
            "支持的参照动作包括 CASCADE 和 SET NULL。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This enhancement improves data integrity within Aurora DSQL, which is critical for applications that rely on consistent and accurate datasets, including those utilized in AI/ML workflows for data storage and feature management. It addresses a previous adoption barrier by ensuring foundational data quality.",
          "zh": "此项增强提升了 Aurora DSQL 的数据完整性，这对于依赖一致准确数据集的应用程序至关重要，包括在AI/ML工作流中用于数据存储和特征管理的系统。它通过确保基础数据质量，解决了此前的一个采用障碍。"
        },
        "source": "InfoQ (AI/ML)",
        "link": "https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/09/aurora-dsql-foreign-keys/?utm_campaign=infoq_content&utm_source=infoq&utm_medium=feed&utm_term=AI%2C+ML+%26+Data+Engineering-news"
